<div class="sprout" style="--hue: 150;">
<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 min-h-screen">
  <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow-xl p-6 sm:p-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white border-b-4 border-blue-500 pb-4 mb-8">
      Privacy Policy for Langlets
    </h1>
    
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">
      <strong class="text-white">Last updated:</strong> <%= Date.current.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>
    </p>
    
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
      Introduction
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      Welcome to Langlets ("we," "our," or "us"). We are committed to protecting your privacy and being transparent about how we handle information when you use our language learning application.
    </p>
    
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
      Information We Collect
    </h2>
    
    <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-200 mt-6 mb-3">
      Personal Information
    </h3>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      Langlets does not require user registration or login. We do not collect, store, or process any personal information such as names, email addresses, or contact details.
    </p>
    
    <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-200 mt-6 mb-3">
      User Data
    </h3>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      We do not save any user-generated content, progress data, or learning activities on our servers. All interactions with the app are processed locally and are not stored permanently.
    </p>
    
    <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-200 mt-6 mb-3">
      Analytics Information
    </h3>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      We use Microsoft Clarity, a user behavior analytics service provided by Microsoft Corporation, to help us understand how users interact with our application. Microsoft Clarity may collect the following information:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-300 mb-6 space-y-2 ml-4">
      <li>Device and browser information (browser type, operating system, screen resolution)</li>
      <li>Usage patterns and interactions within the app (clicks, scrolls, page views)</li>
      <li>Session recordings and heatmaps of user interactions</li>
      <li>IP address (which may be used to determine general geographic location)</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
      How We Use Information
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      The analytics data collected through Microsoft Clarity is used solely to:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-300 mb-6 space-y-2 ml-4">
      <li>Improve the user experience and functionality of Langlets</li>
      <li>Identify and fix technical issues</li>
      <li>Understand usage patterns to enhance our language learning features</li>
      <li>Optimize the app's performance and design</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
      Information Sharing
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      Since we do not collect personal information or user data, there is no personal information to share. The analytics data collected by Microsoft Clarity is governed by Microsoft's privacy policy and is used in accordance with their terms of service.
    </p>
    
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
      Data Security
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      While we do not store user data, we take reasonable measures to ensure the security of our application and protect against unauthorized access to our systems.
    </p>
    
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
      Third-Party Services
    </h2>
    
    <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-200 mt-6 mb-3">
      Microsoft Clarity
    </h3>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      Our app uses Microsoft Clarity for analytics purposes. Microsoft Clarity's collection and use of data is governed by the Microsoft Privacy Statement, which can be found at: 
      <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/en-us/privacystatement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline transition-colors duration-200">
        https://privacy.microsoft.com/en-us/privacystatement
      </a>
    </p>
    
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      You can opt out of Microsoft Clarity data collection by visiting: 
      <a href="https://clarity.microsoft.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 underline transition-colors duration-200">
        https://clarity.microsoft.com/terms
      </a>
    </p>
    
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
      Your Rights and Choices
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      Since we do not collect or store personal information, there is no personal data for you to access, modify, or delete. However, you can:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-300 mb-6 space-y-2 ml-4">
      <li>Use browser settings to disable cookies and tracking</li>
      <li>Opt out of Microsoft Clarity tracking using the link provided above</li>
      <li>Contact us with any privacy-related questions or concerns</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
      Children's Privacy
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      Langlets does not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13 years of age. Since we do not collect personal information from any users, our service is safe for users of all ages.
    </p>
    
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
      International Users
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      Langlets may be accessed by users worldwide. The analytics data collected by Microsoft Clarity may be transferred to and processed in countries other than your own, in accordance with Microsoft's privacy practices.
    </p>
    
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
      Changes to This Privacy Policy
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      We may update this privacy policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or applicable laws. We will post any changes on this page and update the "Last updated" date above. We encourage you to review this privacy policy periodically.
    </p>
    
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4 border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
      Contact Us
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      If you have any questions about this privacy policy or our privacy practices, please contact us at:
    </p>
    <div class="bg-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4 mb-6">
      <p class="text-gray-300">
        <strong class="text-white">Email:</strong> [Your contact email]<br>
        <strong class="text-white">Website:</strong> [Your website URL]
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <hr class="border-gray-600 my-8">
    
    <p class="text-gray-400 italic text-sm">
      This privacy policy is effective as of the date listed above and applies to all users of the Langlets application.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
